WEBVTT

00:16:25.411 --> 00:16:31.581
(Applause)

00:16:38.707 --> 00:16:41.367
Juan Enriquez: So some of this stuff
is a little dense.

00:16:41.391 --> 00:16:43.367
(Laughter)

00:16:43.823 --> 00:16:48.431
But the implications of being able
to control seizures or epilepsy

00:16:48.455 --> 00:16:50.432
with light instead of drugs

00:16:50.456 --> 00:16:53.110
and being able to target
those specifically

00:16:53.134 --> 00:16:54.650
is a first step.

00:16:55.382 --> 00:16:57.526
The second thing
that I think I heard you say

00:16:57.550 --> 00:17:02.378
is you can now control
the brain in two colors,